# firefox in the built-in compositor (private HOME = fresh profile, shm rendering)
Window gui
Size 1000x640
Title "firefox"
Run flatpak run --socket=wayland --env=GSK_RENDERER=cairo --env=MOZ_WEBRENDER=0 org.mozilla.firefox --no-remote about:blank
Sleep 3s
Caption "Real Firefox, no screen needed" bottom
MouseMove 486 342 800ms
MouseClick
Sleep 2s
SendKey C-l
Send "example.org\n"
Sleep 3s
MouseScroll down 3
Sleep 1s
